    {
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "FLAGGED BUT NOT FIXED (out of Task 2 scope): StoreAsync\u0027s existing-entry identity resolution (\u0060LoadIndex(scope).FirstOrDefault(name match)\u0060) relies on a cold read enumerating sidecars via \u0060Directory.EnumerateFiles(storeDir, \u0027*.meta.json\u0027)\u0060, which silently SKIPS a path that has been replaced by a directory of the same name (e.g. sidecar corruption). Previously masked because Upsert always warmed the cache, so a same-instance StoreAsync-then-StoreAsync sequence almost never hit a genuine cold read",
