    {
      "chunkIndex": 4,
      "contentPreview": "AttributeMigration.MigrateStore(dryRun:true)\u0027s \u0027writes nothing\u0027 guarantee only covers its own explicit persist call \u2014 it does NOT protect against LoadIndexUnsafe\u0027s separate, unconditional read-time forward-fill-and-write-back, which runs on ANY cold LoadIndex regardless of dryRun. Don\u0027t assert dry-run-safety via \u0060store.LoadIndex(...)\u0060 after a dry run; assert by re-running MigrateStore (which reads raw via EnumerateRawForMigration, bypassing the cache) and checking the count is unchanged.",
